{"version": 2, "width": 120, "height": 40, "timestamp": 1789848984, "title": "Pyvider linting \u2014 direct provider validation", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}}
[0.5, "o", "\u001b[1;36m$ soup lint tests/e2e/provider-linting/lint.soup.toml --provider \"$PYVIDER_CONFORMANCE_PSP\" --lane direct\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.5, "o", "Direct provider validation: 7/7 cases\r\n  warning: provider: TLS certificate verification is disabled (provide-io/pyvider:insecure-tls)\r\n  warning: resource pyvider_local_directory: Directory permissions are world-writable (provide-io/pyvider:world-writable-directory)\r\n  warning: data-source pyvider_http_api: HTTP API uses an unencrypted connection (provide-io/pyvider:insecure-http)\r\n  warning: ephemeral pyvider_lease: Lease lifetime exceeds one hour (provide-io/pyvider:long-lived-lease)\r\n  warning: list pyvider_file_content: File listing includes hidden files (provide-io/pyvider:include-hidden-files)\r\n  warning: action pyvider_wait_for_file: Action timeout exceeds five minutes (provide-io/pyvider:long-action-timeout)\r\n  warning: state-store pyvider_filesystem_store: State store path is relative (provide-io/pyvider:relative-state-store-path)\r\nOpenTofu native linting: not requested\r\nOpenTofu coverage is separate from direct provider coverage.\r\n"]
